 "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "note": "Opens Login; resolves when the user finishes or leaves",\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "logged_in": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "logged_in"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    "auth.getH5Token": {\n      "level": "L1",\n      "model": "async",\n      "timeout_ms": 10000,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "note": "Takes no params: native requests the scope from the force-update state; while the update check is unknown only read_only, which may call GET endpoints only (BR-ID-32 细则「只读作用域」). The token lives only in the H5 page memory; native does not cache it (03 §5.4)",\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "description": "aud=h5; lifetime and scope per BR-ID-32 (no withdrawal, payout account, real name, deletion, phone change)",\n        "properties": {\n          "token": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "minLength": 1\n          },\n          "expire_at": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "format": "date-time"\n          },\n          "scope": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "enum": [\n              "standard",\n              "read_only"\n            ],\n            "description": "contracts/enums h5_token_scope"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "token",\n          "expire_at",\n          "scope"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    "net.signedRequest": {\n      "level": "L2",\n      "model": "async",\n      "timeout_ms": 15000,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "note": "Native signs with install_secret (BR-ID-09) only for method + path in signed_paths; otherwise 90403 (拍板第二批 TECH-30)",\n      "whitelist_90403": "method + path outside signed_paths (拍板第二批 TECH-30)",\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "method": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "enum": [\n              "POST"\n            ],\n            "description": "Methods present in signed_paths"\n          },\n          "path": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "maxLength": 2048,\n            "pattern": "^/v1(/[A-Za-z0-9_-]+)+(\\\\?[^#]*)?$",\n            "description": "Path plus raw query, without host. Native compares the path part (query removed) exactly with signed_paths; \'.\', \'%\' and empty segments are rejected by the pattern"\n          },\n          "body": {\n            "description": "JSON request body, sent as is"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "method",\n          "path"\n        ]\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "status": {\n            "type": "integer",\n            "minimum": 100,\n            "maximum": 599\n          },\n          "body": {\n            "description": "Parsed JSON response envelope of the API"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "status",\n          "body"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    "ui.toast": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "sync",\n      "timeout_ms": null,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "text": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "minLength": 1,\n            "maxLength": 200\n          },\n          "duration": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "enum": [\n              "short",\n              "long"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "text"\n        ]\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      }\n    },\n    "ui.showLoading": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "sync",\n      "timeout_ms": null,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "text": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "maxLength": 50\n          }\n        },\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      }\n    },\n    "ui.hideLoading": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "sync",\n      "timeout_ms": null,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      }\n    },\n    "ui.setNavBar": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "sync",\n      "timeout_ms": null,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "visible": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          },\n          "title": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "maxLength": 50\n          },\n          "bg_color": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}([0-9A-Fa-f]{2})?$"\n          },\n          "bg_gradient": {\n            "type": "array",\n            "items": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}([0-9A-Fa-f]{2})?$"\n            },\n            "minItems": 2,\n            "maxItems": 4\n          },\n          "bg_image": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "pattern": "^https://",\n            "maxLength": 2048\n          },\n          "text_color": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}([0-9A-Fa-f]{2})?$"\n          },\n          "status_bar_style": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "enum": [\n              "light",\n              "dark"\n            ]\n          },\n          "immersive": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          },\n          "hide_close": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          },\n          "hide_bottom_safe_area": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          },\n          "bounce": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      }\n    },\n    "nav.open": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "async",\n      "timeout_ms": 10000,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "note": "Login requirements of the target page are handled by the router; the entry category is checked as in_app (03 §4.4). While the update check is unknown, only the read-only pages of the BR-ID-10 细则「路由入口矩阵」 open, without any automatic side effect; other targets end with 90500 and are not replayed once the check has a result (03 §4.4「未知状态下的桥调用」). Withdraw, PayoutAccount, LaborAgreement and RealName take no params: params passed are dropped and the page opens as usual (opened=true), nothing is prefilled (BR-WDR-01 细则)",\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "route": {\n            "type": "string",\n            "minLength": 1,\n            "description": "Route name from routes.json; unknown or newer than this app → upgrade page (03 §4.4)"\n          },\n          "params": {\n            "type": "object",\n            "description": "Route params, validated against routes.json",\n            "additionalProperties": true\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "route"\n        ]\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {\n          "opened": {\n            "type": "boolean"\n          }\n        },\n        "required": [\n          "opened"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    "nav.close": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "sync",\n      "timeout_ms": null,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony": "1.0.0"\n      },\n      "params": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      },\n      "result": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "properties": {},\n        "required": []\n      }\n    },\n    "trade.openProduct": {\n      "level": "L0",\n      "model": "async",\n      "timeout_ms": 10000,\n      "phase": "M-内测",\n      "since": {\n        "ios": "1.0.0",\n        "android": "1.0.0",\n        "harmony"