getDict",\n        "tags": [\n          "content"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Enum text dictionary",\n        "description": "The text dictionary of BR-TEXT-12 (02 §10, 04 §6.2 `GET /v1/dict`): clients read a text as\\nconfig.texts first, then this dictionary at `items[<dict>][<code>]`, then the bundled\\ndefault (contracts/texts.default.json), and cache the dictionary by `version`, which\\nequals data.dict_version of GET /v1/config. `version` in the query is only a cache hint:\\nthe response is always the whole current dictionary, also when it equals the current\\nversion (no 304; the client compares versions itself, 编排者默认). A dictionary key\\n`<dict>.<code>` is split at its first dot: `dict` is the first segment and `code` the\\nrest (a key without a dot has the empty string as code). Keys whose current text is null\\n(set back to the bundled default) are left out. Before the first publish `version` is\\n\\"0\\" and `items` is empty. Readable anonymously, without a device id. Session scopes:\\naccepts deletion_only (BR-ID-01 细则「受限会话」: the forced-update and deletion pages\\nread it).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-session-scopes": [\n          "full",\n          "deletion_only"\n        ],\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OptionalDeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "version",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "The dictionary version the client has cached; a hint only, the whole dictionary is returned either way.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "minLength": 1,\n              "maxLength": 32\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The current dictionary.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DictResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "version": "3",\n                    "items": {\n                      "order_status_group": {\n                        "credited": "已到账"\n                      },\n                      "order_status": {\n                        "CREDITED.summary": "这笔返利已到账，可以去钱包提现，详情见卡片。"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/products/search": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "searchProducts",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Search one platform",\n        "description": "Keyword search on one platform (04 §6.3). Coupon-price and rebate sorting reorder only\\nthe current page (拍板第二批 TRADE-20). The cursor is opaque and carries only the search\\nsession and page (BR-PROD-08); no_rebate items are filtered out (BR-PRICE-08). With no\\nresult the response carries `fallback_items` (the platform\'s first 10 feed items). Union\\nfailure without a usable cache returns 50304 with `data.platform` (BR-PROD-07); the\\nproduct pool is never served as search results. Cards only register a link_id with its\\nquote snapshot and are not converted (BR-PRICE-12): buying goes through\\n`POST /v1/links/{link_id}/open`. `x-auth` is optional although 04 §6.3 lists none:\\nrebate amounts are computed for the current user and links are registered per user\\n(BR-PRICE-11, BR-PRICE-12; 08 wins over 04).\\nWhen the search switch search.enabled.<platform> is off the answer is 50304 with\\ndata.reason=search_disabled (BR-PROD-10 细则「按平台的搜索开关」).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          50304\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "platform",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "Platform to search (enum platform).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "q",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "Keyword.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "minLength": 1,\n              "maxLength": 100\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "sort",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Sort order (enum sort); default relevance.",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SortCode"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "has_coupon",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Only items with a coupon.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "boolean"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "price_min_fen",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Lower bound of final_price_fen, inclusive.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "integer",\n              "format": "int64",\n              "minimum": 0\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "price_max_fen",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Upper bound of final_price_fen, inclusive.",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "integer",\n              "format": "int64",\n              "minimum": 0\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Limit"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of results.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SearchProductsResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "ok": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/SearchProductsOk"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/products/{product_key}": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getProduct",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Product detail",\n        "description": "Coupon, final price, estimated rebate and quote time of one product (BR-PRICE-05,\\nBR-PRICE-11), with a freshly registered `link_id` (BR-PRICE-12). On union failure the\\nserver may answer with the product-pool price and `stale=true` (拍板第二批 TRADE-12).\\nA response whose derived key differs from the requested one, or cannot be derived, is\\n30143 ref_expired (BR-PROD-03, BR-PROD-05). `item_ref` of the card the user tapped is\\npassed through unchanged (BR-PROD-11). x-auth optional for the same reason as search.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          30141,\n          30143\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/ProductKey"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "item_ref",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Opaque `item_ref` of the card that was tapped (BR-PROD-11); never parsed.",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemRef"\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The product card of the detail page.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProductResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "ok": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/ProductOk"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/products/{product_key}/price-trend": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getProductPriceTrend",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Price trend of one product",\n        "description": "Final price of the last 30 days for the folded price-trend module of the product detail\\npage (规划/01 F-PROD-14; BR-WATCH-05, BR-WATCH-19, BR-PROD-03). Read only from\\nprice_snapshot; never reads the watch observation tables or any third-party service, so\\nnothing about the product\'s current state (off shelf, ref expired) is reported here.\\nOne point per natural day in +08:00, the last record of that day; records of one day\\nfrom several sources rank detail, then search, then quote. `start_date` is the date of the\\nfirst record in the window (plain date, BR-TEXT-11), `window_days` is 30. Fewer than\\n`price_trend.min_distinct_days` distinct dates, or the platform\'s key_stability not yet\\nstable_7d, gives status=no_data with empty points and null start_date (the client shows\\nprice_trend.empty); an unknown product key is the same no_data. `source_key` is\\nprice_trend.source, or price_trend.source.general for a product whose detail quote\\ncarries no coupon (BR-PRICE-04); the title key follows the same choice. A `platform`\\nthat is not a platform code, or a product key that does not belong to it, is 20001 with\\ndata.fields.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/ProductKey"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "platform",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "Platform of the product (enum platform).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The price trend, or no_data.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProductPriceTrendResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "ok": {\n                    "summary": "Enough records",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 0,\n                      "msg": "",\n                      "data": {\n                        "status": "ok",\n                        "points": [\n                          {\n                            "date": "2026-09-20",\n                            "final_price_fen": 3290\n                          },\n                          {\n                            "date": "2026-09-24",\n                            "final_price_fen": 2990\n                          },\n                          {\n                            "date": "2026-10-01",\n                            "final_price_fen": 2890\n                          }\n                        ],\n                        "start_date": "2026-09-20",\n                        "window_days": 30,\n                        "source_key": "price_trend.source"\n                      },\n                      "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "no_data": {\n                    "summary": "Not enough records",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 0,\n                      "msg": "",\n                      "data": {\n                        "status": "no_data",\n                        "points": [],\n                        "start_date": null,\n                        "window_days": 30,\n                        "source_key": "price_trend.source.general"\n                      },\n                      "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/me/favorites": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "listFavorites",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "My favorites",\n        "description": "Favorites of the current user, newest favorited first (规划/01 F-PROD-12). Each item has\\n`platform`, `product_key`, `favorited_at`, `invalid` and `product_card`. The list card has\\nthe same shape as a search card (ProductCard) and only registers a link and a quote\\nsnapshot, never converts (TRADE-03). `invalid=true` when fetching the card the union\\nanswered that the product does not exist, is off shelf or cannot be promoted; such an\\nitem\'s card has only the title and the image, no price and no rebate_*. Only product\\nreferences and times are stored, never prices, links or tokens. `next_cursor` fetches the\\nnext (older) page; null means no more. A malformed or foreign cursor is 20001 with\\ndata.fields=[cursor].\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {