t most 100 items (规划/01 F-PROD-12); rows are physically\\ndeleted, items that are not favorites are skipped, and the call succeeds. More than 100\\nitems, or an item whose product key does not belong to its platform, is 20001 with\\ndata.fields. Version gate: applied.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BatchDeleteFavoritesRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "items": [\n                  {\n                    "platform": "taobao",\n                    "product_key": "tb:7Kq9LmN3pQ"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    "platform": "jd",\n                    "product_key": "jd:100012345678"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "None of the listed products is a favorite any more.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EmptyResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {},\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/inputs/parse": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "parseInput",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Recognise pasted links, tokens or share text",\n        "description": "Shared by clipboard, search box, share extension and Agent (04 §8.5). At most 3 links or\\ntokens of one text are handled, one card each; the same product key yields one card\\n(BR-PROD-08 ⑤). Cards only register a link_id with the quote snapshot and are never\\nconverted here (拍板第二批 TRADE-03); a pasted link without rebate still yields a card\\nwith `rebate_basis=no_rebate` (BR-PRICE-08). Nothing recognisable as a concrete product\\nreturns 30132 without candidate cards (拍板第二批 TRADE-07); a recognised product\\nwhose key cannot be derived returns 30131 (BR-PROD-03). How a platform turns a link or\\ntoken into a product is the union adapter\'s business and is not visible here. x-auth is\\noptional although 04 §6.3 lists none, for the same reason as search.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": false,