-PRICE-13).\\nA request stopped by 30101, 30102 or 30111 and sent again after the user authorized is a\\nnew request with a new Idempotency-Key; the original key is only for retrying the same\\nrequest (BR-ID-10 细则). 30101 / 30102 carry auth_url, state and auth_methods; 30111\\ncarries auth_jump.\\nA share link opened by anyone but the sharer while the sharer\'s own authorization is no\\nlonger valid (Taobao binding not active, or Pinduoduo filing invalid) gets 30102 (Taobao)\\nor 30111 (Pinduoduo) with data.reason=sharer_auth_invalid and no auth_url, state or\\nauth_jump; this holds during a site-owner authorization outage too (never\\nauth_unavailable here). The opener is not the one to authorize: the client shows no\\nAuthSheet, does not replay the link, offers no no-rebate purchase and shows\\nlink_landing.invalid (BR-ATTR-05 细则「别人的分享 link 不可用」).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          30101,\n          30102,\n          30103,\n          30111,\n          30121,\n          30141,\n          30143,\n          30144,\n          30151,\n          30153,\n          50301,\n          50303,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n        