        "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "stepUpRequired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminStepUpRequiredTotp"\n                  },\n                  "reasonMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminExportReasonInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "fromAfterTo": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminExportTimeRangeInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "adminListExports",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-exports"\n        ],\n        "summary": "List export tasks (own tasks, or everyone\'s with audit.view_all)",\n        "description": "Permission point `export` (04 §11.1; no step-up); lacking it is 10403 with\\n`data.reason=admin_permission_denied`. Tasks of the console\'s app, newest first\\n(`created_at` descending, then the server\'s internal order for the same time), page by page\\n(`page`, `page_size` ≤ 200, above that 20001).\\nVisibility (enforced by the server, BR-ID-34 细则「后台导出任务」): an account holding\\n`audit.view_all` (a super admin holds every point) sees every account\'s tasks, their\\nfilters summary and status; an account without it only sees the tasks it created.\\n`audit.view_all` only widens this list: downloading and retrying stay limited to the\\ncreator (GET /admin/v1/exports/{id}/download, POST /admin/v1/exports/{id}/retry).\\nFilters combine with AND: `status` (enum export_status), `resource` (enum\\nexport_resource), `from` (inclusive) and `to` (exclusive) on `created_at`, ISO 8601 times\\nwith offset (04 §5); `from` later than `to` is 20001 with `data.fields=[from, to]`.\\nRows never carry the download link; status names come from BR-TEXT-25\\nadmin_dict.export_status. Listing does not write an audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "status",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Only tasks in this status (enum export_status).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminExportStatus"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "resource",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Only tasks of this source list (enum export_resource).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminExportResource"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "from",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Earliest creation time, inclusive (ISO 8601 with offset).",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "format": "date-time"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "to",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": false,\n            "description": "Latest creation time, exclusive (ISO 8601 with offset).",\n            "schema": {\n              "type": "string",\n              "format": "date-time"\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of export tasks, newest first.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminExportPageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "items": [\n                      {\n                        "id": "exp_Wb6Hn2Lc9Pq4Sv8T",\n                        "resource": "users",\n                        "filters_summary": "风控状态：全部",\n                        "masked": true,\n                        "created_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                        "created_by_name": "ops01",\n                        "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:40:00+08:00",\n                        "status": "running",\n                        "progress": 45,\n                        "failure_reason": null,\n                        "file_name": null,\n                        "row_count": null,\n                        "expires_at": null\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "id": "exp_Gt5Mj8Dr1Vk7Yp3E",\n                        "resource": "users",\n                        "filters_summary": "风控状态：冻结",\n                        "masked": true,\n                        "created_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                        "created_by_name": "ops01",\n                        "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:20:00+08:00",\n                        "status": "done",\n                        "progress": null,\n                        "failure_reason": null,\n                        "file_name": "users-20261019-0920.csv",\n                        "row_count": 1000,\n                        "expires_at": "2026-10-20T09:21:30+08:00"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "id": "exp_Ra4Fz9Ux2Nh6Qc1B",\n                        "resource": "audit_logs",\n                        "filters_summary": "时间：2026-10-18 00:00 至 2026-10-19 00:00",\n                        "masked": true,\n                        "created_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b02",\n                        "created_by_name": null,\n                        "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:00:00+08:00",\n                        "status": "failed",\n                        "progress": null,\n                        "failure_reason": "生成超时，请重试",\n                        "file_name": null,\n                        "row_count": null,\n                        "expires_at": null\n                      }\n                    ],\n                    "page": 1,\n                    "page_size": 20,\n                    "total": 3\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "description": "Not available (codes in contracts/error-codes.yaml).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "pageSizeTooLarge": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPageSizeInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "fromAfterTo": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminExportTimeRangeInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/exports/{id}/download": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "adminDownloadExport",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-exports"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Get a short-lived signed link to the file of one\'s own finished export (audited)",\n        "description": "Permission point `export` (04 §11.1; no step-up); lacking it is 10403 with\\n`data.reason=admin_permission_denied`. Only the creator of the task can download it, even\\nwith `audit.view_all` (BR-ID-34 细则「后台导出任务」). Every call is authorized again and\\nsigns a new link; no long-lived link is issued. The server also checks that the creator\\nstill holds the permission of the source list (`users` → `user.list`) and, for an unmasked\\nfile (`masked=false`), still holds the pii point it was made under (`pii.reveal_phone`).\\nAnother account\'s task, an unknown id, a task of another app, and a creator who no longer\\nholds those points are all 20001 with `data.fields=[id]` (no probing).\\nOnly a task in status done whose `expires_at` has not passed can be downloaded; any other\\nstatus is 30417 with `data.status` (pending, running, failed, expired, cancelled; a done\\ntask past `expires_at` answers expired even before the server has set the status).\\nThe link `url` is