_id, scp,\\nvalid 2 hours (BR-ID-07). After login app_id is taken from the token only.\\n"\n      },\n      "adminBearerAuth": {\n        "type": "http",\n        "scheme": "bearer",\n        "bearerFormat": "JWT",\n        "description": "`Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>` on every /admin/v1 operation after login (CT-02f).\\nadmin_token is a JWT signed with its own key (aud=admin, not accepted on /v1), valid\\n8 hours and expiring after 30 minutes without activity (BR-ID-34); expired or idle → 10001\\nwithout reason. The console keeps it only in memory and sessionStorage and sends it only in\\nthis header; it is never a cookie, so requests carry no ambient credential and need no\\nCSRF token. The admin API allows CORS only from the exact admin console origin (02 §3.4).\\nThe step-up token of an operation goes in the `X-Step-Up-Token` header (04 §5).\\n"\n      }\n    },\n    "parameters": {\n      "AppId": {\n        "name": "X-App-Id",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "App (brand) the request belongs to; before login it must match the app_id the device was registered with (10403, BR-ID-07).",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "minLength": 1,\n          "maxLength": 32,\n          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$"\n        }\n      },\n      "Platform": {\n        "name": "X-Platform",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "Client platform (enum client_platform, 03 §4.2).",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClientPlatformCode"\n        }\n      },\n      "AppVersion": {\n        "name": "X-App-Version",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "SemVer, the same number on all three apps (拍板第二批 TECH-07).",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+$",\n          "maxLength": 32\n        }\n      },\n      "Build": {\n        "name": "X-Build",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "Build number of the client.",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "maxLength": 32\n        }\n      },\n      "Channel": {\n        "name": "X-Channel",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "Install channel of the app package (enum install_channel); absent for H5.",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InstallChannelCode"\n        }\n      },\n      "TraceId": {\n        "name": "X-Trace-Id",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "Client-generated trace id, echoed as `trace_id` when well-formed.",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TraceId"\n        }\n      },\n      "DeviceId": {\n        "name": "X-Device-Id",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "device_id issued by POST /v1/devices; anything else is 10402 (BR-ID-09).",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id"\n        }\n      },\n      "OptionalDeviceId": {\n        "name": "X-Device-Id",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "device_id issued by POST /v1/devices, when the device is registered.",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Id"\n        }\n      },\n      "IfNoneMatch": {\n        "name": "If-None-Match",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "The ETag of the client\'s last good response (LKG); a match gets 304.",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "maxLength": 512\n        }\n      },\n      "Timestamp": {\n        "name": "X-Timestamp",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "Unix seconds; |server time − ts| ≤ 300 s (BR-ID-09).",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "pattern": "^[0-9]{10}$"\n        }\n      },\n      "Nonce": {\n        "name": "X-Nonce",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "32 lowercase hex characters; (device_id, nonce) unique within 600 s (BR-ID-09).",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{32}$"\n        }\n      },\n      "Sign": {\n        "name": "X-Sign",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "lowercase_hex(HMAC-SHA256(install_secret, METHOD + \\"\\\\n\\" + path with raw query + \\"\\\\n\\" + ts\\n+ \\"\\\\n\\" + nonce + \\"\\\\n\\" + lowercase_hex(sha256(raw body)))) (BR-ID-09).\\n",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"\n        }\n      },\n      "StepUpToken": {\n        "name": "X-Step-Up-Token",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": false,\n        "description": "step_up_token from POST /v1/auth/step-up for the operation\'s x-step-up action (04 §5). Missing,\\nexpired or for another action → 10003 (not 20001; that is why the header is optional).\\n",\n        "schema": {\n          "type": "string",\n          "minLength": 1,\n          "maxLength": 2048\n        }\n      },\n      "TipKeyPath": {\n        "name": "tip_key",\n        "in": "path",\n        "required": true,\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TipKey"\n        }\n      },\n      "IdempotencyKey": {\n        "name": "Idempotency-Key",\n        "in": "header",\n        "required": true,\n        "description": "Required on operations marked I (04 §6); missing → 20001. Same key while processing →\\n40901; same key with another body → 20901; a retry after a timeout reuses the key and gets\\nthe first result (拍板第二批 TRADE-22). On the x-step-up operations a key abandoned through\\nPOST /v1/idempotency-keys/abandon → 20903, without comparing the body (04 §5「幂等」).\\n",\n        "schema": {\n          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IdempotencyKey"\n        }\n      },\n      "UnionPlatform": 