n          "not_launched"\n        ]\n      },\n      "ConfigFeatures": {\n        "type": "object",\n        "additionalProperties": false,\n        "required": [\n          "flags",\n          "platform_status"\n        ],\n        "properties": {\n          "flags": {\n            "type": "object",\n            "description": "Client switches by key: agent.entry.visible, clipboard.enabled.<platform>,\\nhome.fallback, h5.route.<page>.enabled, ui.grayscale (03 §4.3);\\nexternal_page.product_intercept (a platform product page inside the third-party page\\ncontainer goes back to the native product detail) and external_page.union_host_block\\n(the container does not load union platform pages; derived from the server setting of\\nthe same name; a client that cannot read it treats it as on) (BR-ATTR-29);\\nearnings.dashboard.visible (earnings dashboard entry, derived from\\nearnings.dashboard.enabled, BR-FUND-25).\\nClipboard switches (BR-ID-16 细则「服务端开关」): clipboard.enabled.<platform> filters\\nrecognition by e-commerce platform; clipboard.auto_read.<client> (client is ios, android\\nor harmony) turns off automatic clipboard reading on that client. A missing key counts\\nas on; these keys can only turn a feature off, never turn on what the user turned off.\\n",\n            "additionalProperties": {\n              "type": "boolean"\n            }\n          },\n          "platform_status": {\n            "type": "object",\n            "description": "Purchase status by platform code.",\n            "propertyNames": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            },\n            "additionalProperties": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformPurchaseStatus"\n            }\n          },\n          "search_status": {\n            "type": "object",\n            "description": "Search switch by platform code, derived from search.enabled.<platform> (04 §10.1);\\nhow a client treats a missing platform is in BR-PROD-10 细则.\\n",\n        