  map.set('specs/device-hash.vectors.json', '{\n  "$comment": "Device identifier hash test vectors and the initial invalid-hash list (08 BR-ID-09 细则「设备标识的无效值」). device_hash = lowercase_hex(SHA-256(UTF-8 bytes of the identifier with leading and trailing whitespace removed and lower-cased)). Clients decide invalidity before hashing and never hash an invalid identifier; the server rejects a hash on the invalid list with 20001 (data.fields=[device_hash]). invalid_hash_seeds is the initial value of config device.invalid_hashes; operations may add to it. The vectors use ASCII whitespace only; per-identifier format checks (length, character set) are not specified by 08 and are not covered here.",\n  "version": 1,\n  "hash_cases": [\n    {\n      "input": "E621E1F8-C36C-495A-93FC-0C247A3E6E5F",\n      "id_source": "idfv",\n      "note": "IDFV, upper case",\n      "device_hash": "b693983458c90a77f7e7b8e16b6e1f77e5c2a299513bc32320f127e5cc8754f2"\n    },\n    {\n      "input": "e621e1f8-c36c-495a-93fc-0c247a3e6e5f",\n      "id_source": "idfv",\n      "note": "same IDFV, lower case: same hash",\n      "device_hash": "b693983458c90a77f7e7b8e16b6e1f77e5c2a299513bc32320f127e5cc8754f2"\n    },\n    {\n      "input": "  E621E1F8-C36C-495A-93FC-0C247A3E6E5F\\n",\n      "id_source": "idfv",\n      "note": "surrounding ASCII whitespace trimmed",\n      "device_hash": "b693983458c90a77f7e7b8e16b6e1f77e5c2a299513bc32320f127e5cc8754f2"\n    },\n    {\n      "input": "9774D56D682E549D",\n      "id_source": "android_id",\n      "note": "ANDROID_ID, upper case",\n      "device_hash": "5bfed3d9319786b0c7181a2ece549a6b3330e28ba54ddc4185a12e6f7295dd31"\n    },\n    {\n      "input": "9774d56d682e549d",\n      "id_source": "android_id",\n      "note": "ANDROID_ID, lower case: same hash",\n      "device_hash": "5bfed3d9319786b0c7181a2ece549a6b3330e28ba54ddc4185a12e6f7295dd31"\n    },\n    {\n      "input": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718",\n      "id_source": "android_id",\n      "note": "ANDROID_ID",\n      "